  "status_text": "A small floor that NOT gates cannot get under, at every size: a graph made of two matched blocks never fits in three gates. Checked in Lean, on one-a-side inputs, for every n from 3: pick some but not all rows S and some but not all columns T, and join row u to column v when both are inside or both are outside; then no fan-in-two AND/OR/NOT circuit of at most 3 gates represents it [L-meta-25007].",
